                       10382 --3300:  * \param       [in] p_sign_s       An EdDSA signature s.
                       10383 --3301:  * \return
                       10384 --3302:  *  - #PKCD_RET_OK:                       Successful completion
                       10385 --3303:  *  - #PKCD_RET_INTERNALERR:              Internal processing failed
