                       10399 --3317:  *  - None
                       10400 --3318:  *
                       10401 --3319:  * Pseudo-code for the function can be found below.
                       10402 --3320:  *  -# Initialize the variable ret with #PKCD_RET_INTERNALERR.
                       10403 --3321:  *  -# If (NULL != p_ctx) and (NULL != p_buf) and (NULL != p_sign_s)
